Package: quartofix
Title: Restore Quarto Callout Blocks, Tabsets, and Code Annotation Styling in pkgdown Sites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Bjarke", "Hautop", , "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fix a pkgdown rendered site to support quarto callout blocks, tabsets, and code
    annotation styling from quarto vignettes. pkgdown silently destroys the rendering of these.
